{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）中午12時許，屯門內河碼頭一名男船員懷疑在貨船工作期間，不慎從船身約1.5米高處墮下甲板，並陷入昏迷，同事發現後隨即報警求助。人員接報到場，該名持有出入境通行證、51歲姓譚的內地男船員頭部重創，由救護車送往屯門醫院搶救。</p><p>案件列作工業意外有人受傷處理，警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"屯門內河碼頭一名內地男船員懷疑在貨船上不慎墮下甲板，昏迷送院。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189207606770536448062584.jpeg/ytgNP56M5P78a4-qrG75UbjvEuBbxjSftBwi7rQcIu4\"/><figcaption>屯門內河碼頭一名內地男船員懷疑在貨船上不慎墮下甲板，昏迷送院。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名男子陪同傷者入院。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189207771615072256548271.jpeg/Iyzx0RUUxEyNMbubOysqf7bQcDDE8G5Z1CdJDfEnSQ0\"/><figcaption>一名男子陪同傷者入院。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往屯門醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177163586779222016496183.jpeg/jpDW-FDNlyg9lxQqdoCA2uGOL1Ln9SFzvAPw0rwD8NI\"/><figcaption>事主被送往屯門醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.492928+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:37:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:35.818485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:11.863489+00:00","content_hash":"bd8f55db7a7b850600e296315e407d0a8ef38f22841bfcdaeb9928ab79d02d6b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}